WEBVTT

00:11:59.061 --> 00:12:01.703
(Applause)

00:12:01.727 --> 00:12:06.774
Do you really want to use your family,

00:12:06.798 --> 00:12:11.345
do you really ever want to look
at your spouse and your kid,

00:12:11.369 --> 00:12:12.918
and see your jailers?

00:12:14.601 --> 00:12:18.212
There was something
you could have said to your kid,

00:12:18.236 --> 00:12:20.926
when he or she said, "I have a dream."

00:12:22.012 --> 00:12:23.948
You could have said --

00:12:23.972 --> 00:12:27.993
looked the kid in the face and said,

00:12:28.017 --> 00:12:29.799
"Go for it, kid!